# Supabase connection for FarmHelper. Leave both empty to run in local-only mode (no sign-in, data stays on the device).
# Set them to YOUR project's values (Supabase → Project Settings → API). The anon/publishable key is safe to expose;
# row-level security protects the data. See README "Going to production".
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=""
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=""

# Optional: WhatsApp number for the landing-page chat button (digits with country code). Defaults to +263789824741.
VITE_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=""
